  "texts": [
   "Hermes Agent just",
   "dropped another",
   "banger for privacy.",
   "Now they read",
   "your documents",
   "locally, meaning that",
   "if you need to operate",
   "with high confidential",
   "documents from",
   "either your business",
   "or your clients",
   "and you run",
   "Hermes Agent locally,",
   "now you have",
   "zero risk of your data",
   "actually leaking out.",
   "They do this by",
   "using AnyDoc,",
   "which is an open source",
   "PDF analyzer",
   "built by the team",
   "over at Firecrawl.",
   "Now follow for more",
   "AI news, videos, and",
   "tutorials each and",
   "every single day,",
   "and catch you",
   "in the next one."
